# y = x shifted one word right, the word shifted in being the immediate (fp16
# 1.0 pairs): the source walk binds axis 1 with step 1 under a window that
# starts at -1, so element 0 falls outside it, issues no read and is padded.
target ktpu.v9

fn pad.l1(x: f16[256] @dram, y: f16[272] @dram)
    move
        copy w(x - 32, (17, 32, 1, 1), win1=(-1, 16)) -> w(y, (17, 32)) pad=0x3c003c00
